{"4318250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Genesis: Voces de la Niebla (Voices of the Mist)", "steam_appid": 4318250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What would you do if the thing chasing you couldn’t be seen?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something hides within the fog… watching you even when you can’t see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genesis: Voices of the mist</strong> is a raw and disturbing psychological horror experience inspired by the great survival horror classics of the 90s and early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark environments, solve puzzles, and uncover what really happened… if you dare to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, a flashlight, and an atmosphere designed to constantly make you uncomfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/89642eb86e3dcdd8b8cc4ae6671f1dd2.poster.avif?t=1779281302\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/89642eb86e3dcdd8b8cc4ae6671f1dd2.webm?t=1779281302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/89642eb86e3dcdd8b8cc4ae6671f1dd2.mp4?t=1779281302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple investigation soon turns into a disturbing nightmare where every place seems to hide something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The atmosphere, the sound design, and the things you cannot see become your worst enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to something that was already there before you arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/5fd4aa0519fe1e89c632f586ebffce7d.poster.avif?t=1779281302\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/5fd4aa0519fe1e89c632f586ebffce7d.webm?t=1779281302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318250/extras/5fd4aa0519fe1e89c632f586ebffce7d.mp4?t=1779281302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 MAIN FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Inspired by classic psychological horror games from the 90s and 2000s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ Mixed first-person and third-person gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😨 Strong focus on atmosphere, tension, and psychological horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Sound design created to constantly unsettle you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Exploration, puzzles, and implicit storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🇦🇷 Indie game developed by a single person in Argentina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 DEVELOPER’S NOTE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genesis was born as a personal tribute to classic horror games and those uncomfortable experiences that stay in your mind long after you stop playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an experimental, direct, and passion-driven project made for fans of atmospheric psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter the fog?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste